{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41825","headline":"题庐山东寺远大师影堂 · 李中","name":"题庐山东寺远大师影堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远公遗迹在东林，往事名存动苦吟。\n杉桧已依灵塔老，烟霞空锁影堂深。\n入帘轻吹催香印，落石幽泉杂磬音。\n十八贤人消息断，莲池千载月沈沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}